WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:02.723
- [Mark] I know you don't
care what other people think.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.933
You do things your own
way, which is beautiful.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.023
All right, Lin.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.129
Lin, what's new?

00:00:20.129 --> 00:00:23.147
How've you been?

00:00:23.147 --> 00:00:24.183
- I've been all right.

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.093
Been through a lot.

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:31.500
